  the formula will be `y = log( <large_num> / (1 + <large_num>) )` which
  approximates to `log (1)` which is 0.

  >>> x = tf.constant([0.0, 1.0, 50.0, 100.0])
  >>> tf.math.log_sigmoid(x)
  <tf.Tensor: shape=(4,), dtype=float32, numpy=
